1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Pull your transmission dipstick.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,000
This ten-second look is worth checking.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Bright red and clear

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,000
usually means it's doing its job.

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Brown, black, or a burnt smell

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,000
can point to fluid breaking down.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
That's one clue — don't guess.

8
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
It could mean a transmission
already wearing itself out.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Send this to someone who
hasn't checked theirs in years.

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Stop by and we'll take a look —
Nick's Tire and Auto, link in bio.
